//
// SEP Verilator coverage configuration. Passed to Verilator at compile time
// from [coverage.verilator].build_args in sep_sim_cfg.toml.
//
// Every covergroup handle of cov/sv/sep_fcov.sv stays a member of the sampler
// instance. A handle whose samples are all gated off in a build is otherwise
// local to static initialization: its object is freed there while its bins
// stay registered, and coverage.dat reads their counts from freed memory.
`verilator_config
public -module "sep_fcov" -var "u_sep_*_cg"
public -module "sep_fcov" -var "u_sep_*_cp"
